              "text": "<h1><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Empowering human-centered care</span></span></span></span></span></h1>\n<h2><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">care.ai is now part of Stryker</span></h2>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Nurse burnout, fragmented systems and limited resources challenge hospitals every day. Together with care.ai, we are transforming care environments into smart, aware spaces that support more efficient workflows and redefine how care is delivered.</span></span></p>\n",
